        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.6 Inter,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#c7d0d9\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e6edf3;margin-bottom:4px\">Executive &amp; Business &mdash; area home</div><div style=\"color:#8b98a5;margin-bottom:10px\">Entry point for the three executive boards. This page carries one dataset only: trays whose scrape state changed during the selected range. Every other executive number is owned by exactly one board below and is not repeated here.</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 20px 3px 0\"><a href=\"/d/nvis-executive/\">Executive Overview</a></td><td style=\"color:#8b98a5\">estate headline counts, per-Scale-Unit rollup, telemetry completeness and tray-hours lost</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 20px 3px 0\"><a href=\"/d/iren_mkz-cluster-overview/\">Estate Completeness</a></td><td style=\"color:#8b98a5\">trays and GPUs present against the GB300_72x1 nameplate &mdash; 18 trays, 72 GPUs per rack</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 20px 3px 0\"><a href=\"/d/nvis-business-insights/\">Operational Intelligence</a></td><td style=\"color:#8b98a5\">GPU utilisation, power, energy, GPU-hours and GPU memory</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 20px 3px 0\"><a href=\"/d/nvis-impact-analysis/\">Cross-Domain Impact</a></td><td style=\"color:#8b98a5\">blast radius by rack and tray</td></tr></table><div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:12.5px\"><span style=\"color:#8b98a5\">Elsewhere&nbsp;&rsaquo;&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/d/nvis-home/\">NVIS Home &amp; alerts</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href=\"/d/nvis-nodes-detail/\">Tray roster</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href=\"/d/gpu-health/\">GPU health</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href=\"/d/nvis-node-deep-dive/\">Tray deep dive</a></div></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
